DESCRIPTION:________________________________\nFrom: Hamna Hamna <S.F.Hamna@sms.ed.ac.uk>\nSent: 17 June 2026 13:01:44 (UTC+00:00) Dublin\, Edinburgh\, Lisbon\, London\nTo: Vicky MacRae <vicky.macrae@roslin.ed.ac.uk>\; Paul Tang <qtang@ed.ac.uk>\; Xiong Weng <xweng@ed.ac.uk>\; April Tan <X.Tan-22@sms.ed.ac.uk>\; Seungmee Lee <seungmee.lee@roslin.ed.ac.uk>\; Ji-Eun Lee <jlee20@ed.ac.uk>\; Blick\, Charlie (Postgraduate Researcher) <cbb109@pgr.aru.ac.uk>\; Ellie Hansen <Ellie.Hansen@ed.ac.uk>\nCc: Kanchan Phadwal <Kanchan.Phadwal@roslin.ed.ac.uk>\nSubject: PhD dissertation talk: Investigating the Protective Role of Calorie Restriction on Medial Vascular Calcification\nWhen: 16 July 2026 10:00-12:00.\nWhere: Roslin 1-113 (Boardroom)\nHello MacRae lab!\nAs most of you already know\, I am scheduled to defend my PhD thesis on 30th July 2026. I am finally beginning to stress out over it and I wondered if you guys can help me by listening to me talk about my PhD research in our lab meeting. Grilling me with difficult questions is non-optional so please free to ask loads of question. I will also arrange some snacks for motivation.\nI hope to see you guys in-person or online!\nBest\,\nHamna\n________________________________________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/339911056744274?p=y1yXJc9vgY8lKr3J5J\nMeeting ID: 339 911 056 744 274\nPasscode: Dh7pS2Yq\n________________________________\nNeed help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-GB> | System reference<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MWFmMDllMGMtNWFmZC00YzE5LTg4ODEtMGI5ZWQ4ZWY5NmM2%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%222e9f06b0-1669-4589-8789-10a06934dc61%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22e23a70b8-bd62-4d41-adf6-813e5b59ecb7%22%7d>
